  "Change PIN, a sixth that the prompt refuses with the wait, and after 31 s the right PIN",
  "changes it. On an iOS Simulator on Apple silicon the Secure Enclave is available, so the",
  "wrap is device-bound (identity.key flag 05); on an Android emulator the keystore offers only",
  "software keys, so the wrap stays Argon2id (flag 01). The PIN stays ON at the end (593104) so",
  "the runner can read the file; the peer is throwaway.",
  "run (Mac mini): pwsh scripts/fleet.ps1 -Scenario mobile_b5_applock -Peers k",
